            "rubricHtml": "<p>Questions 1–3</p>",
            "selectCount": 1,
            "bodyHtml": "<p>Complete the form below. Write <strong>NO MORE THAN TWO WORDS</strong> for each answer.</p><div><div><strong>Manor Farm — Application Form (Summer fruit picking)</strong></div><p><em>Example:</em> Name: Ben Miller</p><p>Country of origin: the USA &nbsp;·&nbsp; Age: 20</p><p>Visa type: a {{1}}</p><p>Visa valid until: November</p><p>Availability for work: from {{2}} to October</p><p>Heard about job: from the {{3}}</p></div>",
