            "type": "completion",
            "rubricHtml": "<p>Questions 4–10</p>",
            "selectCount": 1,
            "bodyHtml": "<p>Complete the notes below. Write <strong>NO MORE THAN TWO WORDS AND/OR A NUMBER</strong> for each answer.</p><div><div><strong>Manor Farm — Important information for fruit pickers</strong></div><p>Picking season</p><ul><li>Busiest month is {{4}}.</li><li>Exact picking dates depend on the {{5}}.</li></ul><p>Payment</p><ul><li>Pickers over 18 will earn £{{6}} an hour.</li></ul><p>Accommodation</p><ul><li>None on the farm, but there is a {{7}} nearby.</li></ul><p>Transport</p><ul><li>Pickers are advised to travel around by {{8}}.</li></ul><p>Documentation</p><ul><li>Only pickers with a {{9}} will be allowed to work.</li></ul><p>Meals</p><ul><li>Pickers must bring lunch and a day's supply of {{10}}.</li></ul></div>",
            "maxWords": 2
